{
  "doc": "Symbolic datapaths: one Source tree and one table of resolutions, run by tests/test_symbolic_paths.py and js/tests/symbolic-paths.test.js. Every node is a div; `node` is the label path of the resolving node; `row` is the #ROW context; a case has `expect` or `error` (a message fragment).",
